0","kind":"announcement","title":"NEXT FEST BEGINS + NEW LEVEL ON STEAM + FINAL 7 DAYS OF THE KICKSTARTER!","summary":"This is it everyone.Our final push.We have 7 days left in the Kickstarter campaign...and Next Fest started JUST TODAY!!We've officially dropped the new demo content on Steam!So go update/download the demo again and give it a whirl. We're genuinely super excited to finally show you what we've worked on these past few weeks. Some of the stuff here is our best visual work to date, and we have WAY more to improve on for the full game.Go play it!The more people play within the next 72 hours, the more","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T01:59:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693367","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4917610-1845383656394128","game_id":"steam-4917610","kind":"announcement","title":"Nightmere Demo getting BONUS CONTENT for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi everyone!I'm incredibly excited to announce that Nightmere's Demo will be getting ADDITIONAL CONTENT for Steam Next Fest!!!Next Fest starts on October 19th, and we plan to drop the additional content on the same day as well so we can reach new (and existing) players thanks to the algorithm boost Steam will give us.Being selected to participate in Steam's Next Fest is a major milestone for us as the event is an opportunity to put Nightmere out there as a \"real\" game for potentially millions of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T17:05:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4917610-1842846814441662","game_id":"steam-4917610","kind":"announcement","title":"Nightmere's Kickstarter is now LIVE!","summary":"The day has finally come.Nightmere's Kickstarter is LIVE!!!You can back the project here.We want to take this opportunity to thank everyone who has played, supported, and enjoyed our game. Nightmere was never meant to be one-off, and we truly believe its story is unique and worth telling.If you want to support us, please back the Kickstarter so we can fund the development of the game!We hope you've had as much fun playing and tagging along on our Nightmere journey as much we have :)See you in Ni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T22:30:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4917610-1840310314354873","game_id":"steam-4917610","kind":"announcement","title":"Nightmere's Kickstarter Launches September 2nd!","summary":"The Nightmere Kickstarter launches September 2nd, a few weeks from today!If you'd like to follow the journey and be notified when the campaign goes live, you can join the Kickstarter pre-launch page here:PRE-LAUNCH KICKSTARTERSince launching Nightmere's demo on Steam 11 days ago, we've amassed more than 5000 wishlists already.The question that many asked since then was, \"When will the full game come out?\"This is where we need your help: Nightmere will unfold across Nightmere I and Nightmere II, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T18:34:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354873","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4917610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:53Z","error